      }
    },
    "From the Homebrew/install README (\"Uninstall Homebrew\"), with its --path option so it removes only the Homebrew Tankard is showing. It runs in Terminal and asks once more before removing anything.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus der README von Homebrew/install („Uninstall Homebrew“), mit der Option --path, damit nur das Homebrew entfernt wird, das Tankard anzeigt. Es läuft im Terminal und fragt vor dem Entfernen noch einmal nach."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiré du README de Homebrew/install (« Uninstall Homebrew »), avec son option --path pour ne supprimer que le Homebrew affiché par Tankard. Il s’exécute dans Terminal et demande une dernière confirmation avant de supprimer quoi que ce soit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Del README de Homebrew/install (\"Uninstall Homebrew\"), con su opción --path para que solo elimine el Homebrew que Tankard está mostrando. Se ejecuta en Terminal y pregunta una vez más antes de eliminar nada."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew/install のREADME(「Uninstall Homebrew」)に基づき、--path オプションを付けて、Tankardが表示しているHomebrewだけを削除します。ターミナルで実行され、削除前にもう一度確認します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "来自 Homebrew/install README（“Uninstall Homebrew”），带 --path 选项，因此只会移除 Tankard 显示的那个 Homebrew。它在“终端”中运行，并在移除任何内容前再次询问。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Do README do Homebrew/install (\"Uninstall Homebrew\"), com a opção --path para remover apenas o Homebrew exibido pelo Tankard. Executa no Terminal e pergunta mais uma vez antes de remover qualquer coisa."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dal README di Homebrew/install (\"Uninstall Homebrew\"), con l'opzione --path così rimuove solo l'Homebrew mostrato da Tankard. Viene eseguito in Terminale e chiede ancora conferma prima di rimuovere qualcosa."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew/install README(\"Uninstall Homebrew\")의 방법이며, --path 옵션으로 Tankard가 표시 중인 Homebrew만 제거합니다. 터미널에서 실행되며 제거 전에 한 번 더 확인합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From then on Homebrew owns these apps: brew upgrade replaces them with the cask's version, and uninstalling the cask (in Tankard or with brew uninstall) deletes the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Danach gehören diese Apps Homebrew: brew upgrade ersetzt sie durch die Cask-Version, und das Deinstallieren des Casks (in Tankard oder mit brew uninstall) löscht die App."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dès lors, Homebrew gère ces apps : brew upgrade les remplace par la version du cask, et désinstaller le cask (dans Tankard ou avec brew uninstall) supprime l'app."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A partir de ahí, Homebrew gestiona estas apps: brew upgrade las reemplaza por la versión del cask, y desinstalar el cask (en Tankard o con brew uninstall) elimina la app."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以降、これらのアプリは Homebrew が管理します。brew upgrade で cask のバージョンに置き換えられ、cask をアンインストールすると（Tankard でも brew uninstall でも）アプリは削除されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此后这些 App 归 Homebrew 管理：brew upgrade 会将其替换为 cask 的版本，卸载 cask（在 Tankard 中或使用 brew uninstall）会删除该 App。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A partir daí, o Homebrew passa a gerenciar esses apps: brew upgrade os substitui pela versão do cask, e desinstalar o cask (no Tankard ou com brew uninstall) apaga o app."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Da quel momento Homebrew gestisce queste app: brew upgrade le sostituisce con la versione del cask, e disinstallare il cask (in Tankard o con brew uninstall) elimina l'app."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이후 이 앱들은 Homebrew가 관리합니다. brew upgrade는 앱을 cask 버전으로 교체하며, cask를 제거하면(Tankard에서든 brew uninstall로든) 앱이 삭제됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
