    "If a download doesn't match, brew stops for that app and leaves it as it was.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passt ein Download nicht, bricht brew für diese App ab und lässt sie unverändert."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si un téléchargement ne correspond pas, brew s'arrête pour cette app et la laisse telle quelle."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si una descarga no coincide, brew se detiene para esa app y la deja como estaba."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダウンロードが一致しない場合、brew はそのアプリの処理を中止し、元のままにします。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果下载内容不一致，brew 会停止处理该 App 并保持原样。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se um download não conferir, o brew para naquele app e o deixa como estava."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se un download non corrisponde, brew si ferma per quell'app e la lascia com'era."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "다운로드가 일치하지 않으면 brew는 해당 앱을 중단하고 그대로 둡니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If “%@” is an app, Homebrew can't find it because apps (casks) are turned off. Turning them on is a one-time download of about 620 MB.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Falls „%@“ eine App ist, findet Homebrew sie nicht, weil Apps (Casks) ausgeschaltet sind. Das Einschalten ist ein einmaliger Download von etwa 620 MB."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si « %@ » est une app, Homebrew ne la trouve pas car les apps (casks) sont désactivées. Les activer demande un téléchargement unique d’environ 620 Mo."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si “%@” es una app, Homebrew no la encuentra porque las apps (casks) están desactivadas. Activarlas requiere una única descarga de unos 620 MB."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se “%@” è un'app, Homebrew non la trova perché le app (cask) sono disattivate. Attivarle richiede un unico download di circa 620 MB."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」がアプリの場合、アプリ(cask)がオフになっているためHomebrewは見つけられません。オンにするには、約620 MBを1回だけダウンロードします。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”이(가) 앱이라면, 앱(cask)이 꺼져 있어서 Homebrew가 찾을 수 없습니다. 켜려면 약 620 MB를 한 번만 다운로드하면 됩니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果“%@”是一个 App，Homebrew 找不到它，因为 App（cask）已关闭。开启只需一次性下载约 620 MB。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se “%@” for um app, o Homebrew não consegue encontrá-lo porque os apps (casks) estão desativados. Ativá-los é um download único de cerca de 620 MB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
