          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opened in Terminal. It lists the commands again and waits for Return. When it finishes, open a new terminal window and click Refresh here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im Terminal geöffnet. Es listet die Befehle erneut auf und wartet auf die Eingabetaste. Öffne danach ein neues Terminalfenster und klicke hier auf „Aktualisieren“."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvert dans Terminal. Il liste de nouveau les commandes et attend Retour. Une fois terminé, ouvrez une nouvelle fenêtre de Terminal et cliquez sur Actualiser ici."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abierto en Terminal. Vuelve a listar los comandos y espera a que pulses Retorno. Cuando termine, abre una nueva ventana de Terminal y haz clic en Actualizar aquí."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ターミナルで開きました。コマンドをもう一度一覧表示し、Returnを待ちます。完了したら新しいターミナルウインドウを開き、ここで「更新」をクリックしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在“终端”中打开。它会再次列出这些命令并等待按下 Return。完成后，请打开新的终端窗口，然后在此处点按“刷新”。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aberto no Terminal. Ele lista os comandos novamente e aguarda Return. Quando terminar, abra uma nova janela do Terminal e clique em Atualizar aqui."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aperto nel Terminale. Elenca di nuovo i comandi e attende Invio. Al termine, apri una nuova finestra del terminale e clicca su Aggiorna qui."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "터미널에서 열었습니다. 명령을 다시 나열하고 Return 키를 기다립니다. 끝나면 새 터미널 윈도우를 열고 여기서 새로 고침을 클릭하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opened in Terminal. It waits for Return, then Homebrew's uninstaller asks once more. When it finishes, quit Tankard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im Terminal geöffnet. Es wartet auf die Eingabetaste, danach fragt der Homebrew-Uninstaller noch einmal nach. Beende Tankard, sobald er fertig ist."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvert dans Terminal. Il attend Retour, puis le programme de désinstallation de Homebrew demande une dernière confirmation. Une fois terminé, quittez Tankard."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abierto en Terminal. Espera a que pulses Retorno y luego el desinstalador de Homebrew pregunta una vez más. Cuando termine, cierra Tankard."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ターミナルで開きました。Returnを待ってから、Homebrewのアンインストーラがもう一度確認します。完了したらTankardを終了してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在“终端”中打开。它会等待按下 Return，然后 Homebrew 的卸载程序会再确认一次。完成后，请退出 Tankard。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aberto no Terminal. Ele aguarda Return e, em seguida, o desinstalador do Homebrew pergunta mais uma vez. Quando terminar, encerre o Tankard."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aperto nel Terminale. Attende Invio, poi il programma di disinstallazione di Homebrew chiede ancora una volta conferma. Al termine, chiudi Tankard."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "터미널에서 열었습니다. Return 키를 기다린 뒤 Homebrew의 제거 프로그램이 한 번 더 확인합니다. 끝나면 Tankard를 종료하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens System Settings, where macOS offers the Command Line Tools update": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet die Systemeinstellungen, wo macOS das Update der Command Line Tools anbietet"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvre Réglages Système, où macOS propose la mise à jour des Command Line Tools"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre Ajustes del Sistema, donde macOS ofrece la actualización de las Herramientas de Línea de Comandos"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apre Impostazioni di Sistema, dove macOS propone l'aggiornamento degli strumenti da riga di comando"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "システム設定を開きます。macOSがそこでコマンドラインツールのアップデートを提供します"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS가 명령줄 도구 업데이트를 제공하는 시스템 설정을 엽니다"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开“系统设置”，macOS 会在那里提供命令行工具更新"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre os Ajustes do Sistema, onde o macOS oferece a atualização das Ferramentas de Linha de Comando"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens Tankard when you log in, as a macOS login item.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet Tankard bei der Anmeldung als macOS-Anmeldeobjekt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvre Tankard à l’ouverture de session, comme élément d’ouverture macOS."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre Tankard cuando inicias sesión, como elemento de inicio de sesión de macOS."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ログイン時にmacOSのログイン項目としてTankardを開きます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录 Mac 时作为 macOS 登录项打开 Tankard。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre o Tankard quando você inicia a sessão, como item de login do macOS."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apre Tankard quando accedi, come elemento di login di macOS."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 로그인 항목으로 로그인할 때 Tankard를 엽니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens Terminal. Nothing is typed or run for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Öffnet das Terminal. Es wird nichts für dich eingegeben oder ausgeführt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvre Terminal. Rien n’est saisi ni exécuté à votre place."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre Terminal. No se escribe ni se ejecuta nada por ti."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ターミナルを開きます。入力や実行は自動では行われません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开“终端”。不会为你输入或运行任何内容。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abre o Terminal. Nada é digitado ou executado por você."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apre il Terminale. Nulla viene digitato o eseguito al posto tuo."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "터미널을 엽니다. 자동으로 입력되거나 실행되는 것은 없습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Optional, not run: delete the core clone with brew untap homebrew/core. Terminal windows that were already open keep the old settings until reopened. From d4rkwyng/intelbrew's README, \"How do I go back to upstream Homebrew?\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional, nicht ausgeführt: den Core-Klon mit brew untap homebrew/core löschen. Bereits geöffnete Terminalfenster behalten die alten Einstellungen, bis sie neu geöffnet werden. Aus der README von d4rkwyng/intelbrew, „How do I go back to upstream Homebrew?“."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Facultatif, non exécuté : supprimez le clone de core avec brew untap homebrew/core. Les fenêtres de Terminal déjà ouvertes gardent les anciens réglages jusqu’à leur réouverture. Extrait du README de d4rkwyng/intelbrew, \"How do I go back to upstream Homebrew?\"."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opcional, no se ejecuta: elimina el clon de core con brew untap homebrew/core. Las ventanas de Terminal ya abiertas conservan los ajustes anteriores hasta que se vuelvan a abrir. Del README de d4rkwyng/intelbrew, \"How do I go back to upstream Homebrew?\"."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任意。実行はされません: brew untap homebrew/core でcoreのクローンを削除します。すでに開いているターミナルウインドウは、開き直すまで古い設定のままです。d4rkwyng/intelbrewのREADME「How do I go back to upstream Homebrew?」より。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可选，不会运行：用 brew untap homebrew/core 删除 core 克隆。已打开的终端窗口在重新打开前仍使用旧设置。摘自 d4rkwyng/intelbrew 的 README，“How do I go back to upstream Homebrew?”。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opcional, não executado: exclua o clone do core com brew untap homebrew/core. As janelas do Terminal que já estavam abertas mantêm os ajustes antigos até serem reabertas. Do README de d4rkwyng/intelbrew, \"How do I go back to upstream Homebrew?\"."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Facoltativo, non eseguito: elimina il clone di core con brew untap homebrew/core. Le finestre del Terminale già aperte mantengono le vecchie impostazioni finché non vengono riaperte. Dal README di d4rkwyng/intelbrew, \"How do I go back to upstream Homebrew?\"."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "선택 사항이며 실행되지 않음: brew untap homebrew/core로 core 클론을 삭제합니다. 이미 열려 있던 터미널 윈도우는 다시 열 때까지 이전 설정을 유지합니다. d4rkwyng/intelbrew의 README, \"How do I go back to upstream Homebrew?\"에서 발췌."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Or have Homebrew replace it, in Terminal:": {
