        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você pode usar este diretamente no Terminal. Desmarque-o para mantê-lo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your HOMEBREW_*, proxy and XDG_CONFIG_HOME settings and what Tankard does with each when it runs brew.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine HOMEBREW_*-, Proxy- und XDG_CONFIG_HOME-Einstellungen und was Tankard damit macht, wenn es brew ausführt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos réglages HOMEBREW_*, proxy et XDG_CONFIG_HOME, et ce que Tankard en fait quand il lance brew."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus ajustes HOMEBREW_*, de proxy y XDG_CONFIG_HOME, y qué hace Tankard con cada uno al ejecutar brew."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HOMEBREW_*、プロキシ、XDG_CONFIG_HOME の設定と、Tankard が brew を実行するときのそれぞれの扱い。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 HOMEBREW_*、代理和 XDG_CONFIG_HOME 设置，以及 Tankard 运行 brew 时如何处理每一项。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seus ajustes HOMEBREW_*, de proxy e XDG_CONFIG_HOME, e o que o Tankard faz com cada um ao executar o brew."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le tue impostazioni HOMEBREW_*, proxy e XDG_CONFIG_HOME, e cosa fa Tankard con ciascuna quando esegue brew."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HOMEBREW_*, 프록시, XDG_CONFIG_HOME 설정과 Tankard가 brew를 실행할 때 각각을 어떻게 처리하는지."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Homebrew settings (brew.env) decide which old versions Clean Up keeps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Homebrew-Einstellungen (brew.env) legen fest, welche alten Versionen „Aufräumen“ behält."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos réglages Homebrew (brew.env) décident des anciennes versions que le nettoyage conserve."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu configuración de Homebrew (brew.env) decide qué versiones anteriores conserva la limpieza."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クリーンアップで残す古いバージョンは、Homebrew の設定（brew.env）で決まります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理时保留哪些旧版本，由你的 Homebrew 设置（brew.env）决定。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suas configurações do Homebrew (brew.env) decidem quais versões antigas a limpeza mantém."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le tue impostazioni di Homebrew (brew.env) decidono quali versioni precedenti la pulizia conserva."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "정리할 때 남길 이전 버전은 Homebrew 설정(brew.env)에서 정합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Homebrew settings use a different password program, so Tankard can't ask for your password here. Run this step in Terminal:": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Homebrew-Einstellungen nutzen ein anderes Passwortprogramm, daher kann Tankard hier nicht nach deinem Passwort fragen. Führe diesen Schritt im Terminal aus:"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos réglages Homebrew utilisent un autre programme de mot de passe, Tankard ne peut donc pas vous demander votre mot de passe ici. Exécutez cette étape dans Terminal :"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tus ajustes de Homebrew usan otro programa de contraseñas, así que Tankard no puede pedirte la contraseña aquí. Ejecuta este paso en Terminal:"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le tue impostazioni di Homebrew usano un altro programma per la password, quindi Tankard non può chiederti la password qui. Esegui questo passaggio nel Terminale:"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrewの設定で別のパスワードプログラムを使っているため、Tankardはここでパスワードを求められません。この手順はターミナルで実行してください:"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Homebrew 설정에서 다른 암호 프로그램을 사용하므로, Tankard가 여기서 암호를 요청할 수 없습니다. 이 단계를 터미널에서 실행하세요:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的 Homebrew 设置使用了其他密码程序，因此 Tankard 无法在这里询问你的密码。请在“终端”中运行此步骤："
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seus ajustes do Homebrew usam outro programa de senha, então o Tankard não pode pedir sua senha aqui. Execute esta etapa no Terminal:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
